  (text "INT-008 sequence: VBUS -> 3V3 -> MCU boots -> enumerates -> SENSOR_EN -> sensors -> MCU_TX_EN -> TX rail."
    (at 12.70 223.52 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "c5f94e69-fa20-40d1-b52c-0ba1f5a1752e")
  )
  (text "TX_ON = MCU_TX_EN AND (UVLO ok) AND (OV ok). Failsafe: TX off in reset (PD R112); UVLO open-drain pulls low; OV via Q101."
    (at 12.70 229.87 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "419d1dd7-3d18-4b1c-a200-560c11bc3a3a")
  )
  (text "PWR-001: ITH=300mA/ILIM=450mA set on TX sheet (RIS=100m). PTC F1 hold 500mA. TX bulk 3x47uF on TX sheet."
    (at 12.70 236.22 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "3925b87e-1454-4301-bbfe-3e20b617864a")
  )
  (text "PWR-004: TX + sensor rails off until SET_CONFIGURATION (FW). Pre-enum load = MCU + LDO quiescent only."
    (at 12.70 242.57 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "7b406fc5-2fbe-4d3e-90ec-c5b8ee8d4cd6")
  )
  (text "PWR-009: suspend = TX rail off, sensors in SPI shutdown, MCU sleep. Total < 0.5mA (budget 2.5mA)."
    (at 12.70 248.92 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "75995a9b-22aa-4149-ab65-a4aa0b02c0d8")
  )
  (text "ELEC-010: bulk 4.7-10uF within 10mm of every IC rail entry (layout)."
    (at 12.70 255.27 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "7c98c5cb-446b-41f0-9685-c2bedf3c7cc7")
  )
  (text "PWR_FLAGs at VBUS/GND/VBUS_TX entry points (VBUS originates at USB-C on MCU sheet)."
